      "id": 178516,
      "name": "Reverend Pete",
      "username": "Reverend_Pete",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-12T01:50:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Key for me was getting out an Infrared Eyepiece ASAP. &nbsp;Omnitron (like most villains) isn't nearly as much of a threat if you can keep the nasty cards away.</p><p>Haka had fun with Punish the Weak, Absolute Zero mostly skipped his turn to keep the Self-destruct Sequence at bay, Bunker drew a bazillion cards via Ammo Drop, Fanatic Emboldened Haka, and Wraith Eyepieced like it was going out of style.</p><p>I did manage to win by destroying a Cryo Chamber, which is a card I rarely play! Fun times!</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:02:43.512Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
