      "id": 178517,
      "name": "LewdDolphin21",
      "username": "LewdDolphin21",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lewddolphin21/{size}/1893_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-12T02:40:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint! I Emboldened Bunker, which with Heavy Plating, Flak Cannon, and Maintenance Unit resulted in a profit of 1 HP while still dealing 3 projectile damage. In my last turn I replaced the HP recovery with a 12-damage Omni-Cannon, which was sick.</p><p>Infra-red Eyepiece is so vital to prevent Omnitron from destroying your stuff. I successfully managed to bury both Technological Singularities and the second Sedative Flachettes that way. I also didn't see a Pervasive Red Dust, perhaps due to having played two Adhesive Foam Grenades. Thus my match was not at all hero-threatening.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
