      "name": "Melkhor",
      "username": "Melkhor",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-13T09:39:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Got what ended up as a comfortable Mint here at the end, though it still felt more than a little hairy as the four cards left in Omnitron's deck when he finally went offline were: Technological Singularity, Terraforming and Electro-Pulse Explosive x2.</p><p>I didn't manage to dodge the first singularity, but thankfully, a Meteor Storm was up to at least shield me from the damage, and I think the Pervasive Red Dust hit me no less than 3 times!</p>",
