    {
      "id": 178521,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-16T04:12:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;No Infrared Eyepiece here - just a brutal smack down. &nbsp;I timed a Throat Jab to shield us from the first Technological Singularity, but it still hurt. &nbsp;Game ended after a round of Divine Focus, a 14 card Haka of Battle (which nearly killed me, because Interpolation Beam was out, Haka was at 4, and Omnitron was getting +1, which I had forgotten about. &nbsp;Fortunately, I had left Smoke Bombs out for just this eventuality), and a 3 card Inventory Barrage won the day. &nbsp;</p><p>Actually, Fanatic killed herself to keep her Divine Focus out, but she was wearing her Aegis of Resurrection, so she got better.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:02:43.841Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
