      "created_at": "2016-07-18T02:57:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. Yeah, this one was pretty straightforward -- Infrared Eye-Piece FTW. My only (extremely) minor misstep was trying to use AZ's base power to attack when I had the Cryo Chamber out, so I wasted a phase, but aside from that, no real surprises. Though I did get more use out of Punish the Weak than I usually do. Which is to say I usually don't bother with it, but it was handy for getting over the DR advanced mode brings.</p>",
